#: edoko/templates/signup_sent.html:6
msgid ""
"We send one mail at a time. If it does not arrive, look in your spam "
"folder; you can ask again when the link has expired."
msgstr ""
"Wir schicken immer nur eine E-Mail. Wenn sie nicht ankommt, schau im "
